<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index rises 2.6 points to 747.9 pts.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index rises 2.6 points to 747.9 pts.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, rose 2.6 points on Monday to 747.9 points, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Eight of the ten sectoral indices rose, with the energy index rising the most, up 15 points to 910.1.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
